      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on this new noir screenplay. its set in a pretty rough part of a big city, like the kind of place where the cops dont bother going. im trying to flesh out some of the side characters to make the setting feel more authentic. can u help me brainstorm some descriptions for a few low-level street criminals and some local neighborhood types? i want them to feel gritty and real, not like movie stereotypes.",
